    "body": "@karwa The ability to percent-encode unusual characters in CBAB paths would be the ideal case. Sadly, I doubt that will be web-compatible. In fact, I think it'll be difficult just to encode spaces in _hierarchical_ non-special URL paths (in Chrome and Firefox that is – Safari already does that).",
